ado juicio.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bTQncOqaAvZU0ngJRdI8myoGIeo.jpg","released":"2025-03-27T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"41 min"},{"id":"tt36241713:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"¿La maldición de Cantat?","overview":"En 2007, Bertrand Cantat se muda con su exesposa Krisztina Rády. Pero en 2010, ella muere de forma trágica tras dejar unos inquietantes mensajes telefónicos.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mHGNXrOBuiPcDMzgQqqaqyGuwPb.jpg","released":"2025-03-27T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"42 min"}]}}